<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millenium started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millenium started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said it initiated coverage of Millenium Chemicals Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- The company is being spun off from Hanson Plc and is due to begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on October 2, 1996, under the symbol MCH.N.</p>
</text>
